                "loc": "EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 14:22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, amito wipoy gim'otimere gi kwarere mawan ma joluwo Musa. Joje jowotho i pendi pondeponde, aka joje joluwo i dier Nam M'obokere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joje jolimo batisimo i pondeponde kodi i nam paka joma luwo Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 16:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joje jocamo mugat nger acel m'owok bongi Were, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 17:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwan 20:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jomadho gir'amadha nger acel m'owok bongi Were; ato jomadho pi m'owok i tele m'owotho gi jo aka meno oyido obedo Kristo won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwan 14:29-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno Were k'osangala kodi jom'oloyo i thotho kwoŋ jo, am'omiyo obol jo woko i thim to jotho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
